@tag('Endorsed')
Dashboard seed_fy_poc_fiscal_calendar_copy {
  title: 'Seed Company Fiscal Calendar — PoC'
  description: @md
An isolated PoC showing safe Oct–Sep fiscal windows and a switchable reporting grain, built twice: once on a hand-written SQL query model, once entirely in AQL.
  ;;
  theme: seed_company

  block t_windows_intro: TextBlock {
    content: @md
# Fiscal windows that read like the business

Seed's fiscal year runs **1 October–30 September** and is named by the year in which it ends. Pick a familiar business period below—the date dimension resolves both edges from today, so a finished period closes on its own boundary and a period in flight runs to today. Then choose how coarsely to roll it up.
    ;;
  }
  block v_window_selector: VizBlock {
    label: 'Choose a date-relative window'
    viz: MarkdownViz {
      dataset: seed_fy_poc_windows_sql
      rows: [
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous FY Complete'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.in_previous_fy)
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Current FY to Today'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.in_current_fy_to_today)
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous FQ Complete'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.in_previous_fq)
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Current FQ to Today'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.in_current_fq_to_today)
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous Month Complete'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.in_previous_month)
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Current Month to Today'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.in_current_month_to_today)
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous FY Start'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.previous_fy_start)
          format {
            type: 'date'
            pattern: 'LLL dd, yyyy'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous FY End'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.previous_fy_end)
          format {
            type: 'date'
            pattern: 'LLL dd, yyyy'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Current FY Start'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.current_fy_start)
          format {
            type: 'date'
            pattern: 'LLL dd, yyyy'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous FQ Start'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.previous_fq_start)
          format {
            type: 'date'
            pattern: 'LLL dd, yyyy'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous FQ End'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.previous_fq_end)
          format {
            type: 'date'
            pattern: 'LLL dd, yyyy'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Current FQ Start'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.current_fq_start)
          format {
            type: 'date'
            pattern: 'LLL dd, yyyy'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous Month Start'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.previous_month_start)
          format {
            type: 'date'
            pattern: 'LLL dd, yyyy'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous Month End'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.previous_month_end)
          format {
            type: 'date'
            pattern: 'LLL dd, yyyy'
          }
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Current Month Start'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.current_month_start)
          format {
            type: 'date'
            pattern: 'LLL dd, yyyy'
          }
        }
      ]
      content: @md <style>
  [data-uname="v_window_selector"] .ci-viz-result {
    overflow: visible !important;
  }

  [data-uname="v_window_selector"] .h-full {
    overflow: visible !important;
  }

  [data-uname="v_window_selector"] .text-content, [data-uname="v_window_selector"] .vue-markdown {
    overflow: visible !important;
  }

  [data-uname="v_window_selector"] {
    z-index: 50 !important;
    position: relative;
  }

  .fiscal-dropdown { width:100%; max-width:280px; font-size:14px; outline:none; }
  .fiscal-dropdown-summary { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; padding:8px 14px; border:2px solid #CDC3B0; border-radius:10px; background:#FFFFFF; color:#323232; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; user-select:none; }
  .fiscal-dropdown-summary::after { content:'▾'; font-size:12px; color:#636466; transition:transform 160ms ease; flex:0 0 auto; }
  .fiscal-dropdown-summary:hover { border-color:#E35C2A; }
  .fiscal-dropdown:focus-within .fiscal-dropdown-summary { border-bottom-left-radius:0; border-bottom-right-radius:0; border-color:#E35C2A; }
  .fiscal-dropdown:focus-within .fiscal-dropdown-summary::after { transform:rotate(180deg); }

  .fiscal-panel { display:none; background:#FFFFFF; border:2px solid #CDC3B0; border-top:none; border-radius:0 0 10px 10px; overflow:visible; outline:none; }
  .fiscal-dropdown:focus-within .fiscal-panel { display:block; border-color:#E35C2A; border-top:none; }

  .fiscal-group { border-bottom:1px solid #E7E1D2; }
  .fiscal-group:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
  .fiscal-group-summary { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:9px 14px; cursor:pointer; list-style:none; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.02em; color:#636466; user-select:none; outline:none; }
  .fiscal-group-summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
  .fiscal-group-summary::after { content:'▸'; font-size:11px; transition:transform 160ms ease; }
  .fiscal-group[open] .fiscal-group-summary::after { transform:rotate(90deg); }
  .fiscal-group-summary:hover { background:#FBF8F2; }
  .fiscal-children { display:flex; flex-direction:column; padding:0 6px 6px; }
  .fiscal-preset { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; padding:8px 10px 8px 20px; margin:1px 0; border:2px solid transparent; border-radius:8px; background:transparent; color:#323232; text-decoration:none; cursor:pointer; transition:all 160ms ease; }
  .fiscal-preset:hover { border-color:#E35C2A; background:#FBF8F2; }
  .fiscal-preset.h-drill-selected, .h-drill-selected.fiscal-preset, .fiscal-preset:has(.h-drill-selected) { border-color:#41452B; background:#41452B; color:#FFFFFF; }
  .fiscal-preset-title { font-size:13px; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap; }
  .fiscal-preset-date { font-family:'Red Hat Mono',ui-monospace,monospace; font-size:10px; line-height:1.35; white-space:normal; color:#636466; text-align:right; }
  .fiscal-preset.h-drill-selected .fiscal-preset-date, .h-drill-selected.fiscal-preset .fiscal-preset-date, .fiscal-preset:has(.h-drill-selected) .fiscal-preset-date { color:#F7F1E7; }
  .fiscal-preset:has(.h-drill-selected) .fiscal-preset-title { color:#FFFFFF; }

  /* --- selected value shown in the summary --- */
  .fiscal-current { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; text-align:left; min-width:0; }
  .fiscal-current-label::before { content:'Select period'; color:#636466; }
  .fiscal-current-date { display:none; font-family:'Red Hat Mono',ui-monospace,monospace; font-size:10px; font-weight:500; line-height:1.35; color:#636466; }

  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="0"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before,
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="0"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before { content:'Last FY'; color:#323232; }
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="1"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before,
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="1"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before { content:'This FY'; color:#323232; }
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="2"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before,
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="2"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before { content:'Last FQ'; color:#323232; }
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="3"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before,
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="3"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before { content:'This FQ'; color:#323232; }
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="4"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before,
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="4"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before { content:'Last month'; color:#323232; }
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="5"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before,
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="5"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-label::before { content:'This month'; color:#323232; }

  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="0"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="0"],
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="0"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="0"],
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="1"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="1"],
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="1"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="1"],
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="2"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="2"],
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="2"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="2"],
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="3"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="3"],
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="3"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="3"],
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="4"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="4"],
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="4"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="4"],
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="5"].h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="5"],
  .fiscal-dropdown:has([row="5"] .h-drill-selected) .fiscal-current-date[data-row="5"] { display:block; }
</style>
<div class="fiscal-dropdown" tabindex="0">
  <div class="fiscal-dropdown-summary">
    <span class="fiscal-current">
      <span class="fiscal-current-label"></span>
      <span class="fiscal-current-date" data-row="0">{{ rows[0].`Previous FY Start` }} &rarr; {{ rows[0].`Previous FY End` }}</span>
      <span class="fiscal-current-date" data-row="1">{{ rows[0].`Current FY Start` }} &rarr; today</span>
      <span class="fiscal-current-date" data-row="2">{{ rows[0].`Previous FQ Start` }} &rarr; {{ rows[0].`Previous FQ End` }}</span>
      <span class="fiscal-current-date" data-row="3">{{ rows[0].`Current FQ Start` }} &rarr; today</span>
      <span class="fiscal-current-date" data-row="4">{{ rows[0].`Previous Month Start` }} &rarr; {{ rows[0].`Previous Month End` }}</span>
      <span class="fiscal-current-date" data-row="5">{{ rows[0].`Current Month Start` }} &rarr; today</span>
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="fiscal-panel" tabindex="-1">
    <details class="fiscal-group" open>
      <summary class="fiscal-group-summary">Fiscal Year</summary>
      <div class="fiscal-children">
        <h-drill row="0" value="true" class="fiscal-preset"><div class="fiscal-preset-title">Last FY</div><div class="fiscal-preset-date">{{ rows[0].`Previous FY Start` }}<br>&rarr; {{ rows[0].`Previous FY End` }}</div></h-drill>
        <h-drill row="1" value="true" class="fiscal-preset"><div class="fiscal-preset-title">This FY</div><div class="fiscal-preset-date">{{ rows[0].`Current FY Start` }}<br>&rarr; today</div></h-drill>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="fiscal-group">
      <summary class="fiscal-group-summary">Fiscal Quarter</summary>
      <div class="fiscal-children">
        <h-drill row="2" value="true" class="fiscal-preset"><div class="fiscal-preset-title">Last FQ</div><div class="fiscal-preset-date">{{ rows[0].`Previous FQ Start` }}<br>&rarr; {{ rows[0].`Previous FQ End` }}</div></h-drill>
        <h-drill row="3" value="true" class="fiscal-preset"><div class="fiscal-preset-title">This FQ</div><div class="fiscal-preset-date">{{ rows[0].`Current FQ Start` }}<br>&rarr; today</div></h-drill>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="fiscal-group">
      <summary class="fiscal-group-summary">Month</summary>
      <div class="fiscal-children">
        <h-drill row="4" value="true" class="fiscal-preset"><div class="fiscal-preset-title">Last month</div><div class="fiscal-preset-date">{{ rows[0].`Previous Month Start` }}<br>&rarr; {{ rows[0].`Previous Month End` }}</div></h-drill>
        <h-drill row="5" value="true" class="fiscal-preset"><div class="fiscal-preset-title">This month</div><div class="fiscal-preset-date">{{ rows[0].`Current Month Start` }}<br>&rarr; today</div></h-drill>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</div>  ;;
      settings {
        aggregate_awareness {
          enabled: true
          debug_comments: true
        }
      }
    }
    settings {
      hide_controls: true
    }
  }

  block f_grain: FilterBlock {
    label: 'Aggregate by'
    type: 'field'
    source: FieldFilterSource {
      dataset: seed_fy_poc_windows_sql
      field: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.grain)
    }
    default {
      operator: 'is'
      value: 'Month'
    }
    settings {
      input_type: 'single'
    }
  }

  block k_selected_gmv: VizBlock {
    label: 'Selected-period GMV'
    viz: MetricKpi {
      dataset: seed_fy_poc_windows_sql
      value: VizFieldFull {
        ref: r(seed_fy_poc_windows_sql.gmv_window)
        label: ' '
        format {
          type: 'number'
          pattern: '[$$]#,###0'
        }
      }
      settings {
        display_mode: 'single'
        alignment: 'center'
      }
    }
  }

  block v_window_series: VizBlock {
    label: 'GMV across the selected window, at the selected grain'
    viz: CombinationChart {
      dataset: seed_fy_poc_windows_sql
      x_axis: VizFieldFull {
        ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_sql.period_label)
        label: 'Period'
        format {
          type: 'text'
        }
      }
      y_axis {
        label: 'GMV'
        series {
          mark_type: 'line'
          field: VizFieldFull {
            ref: r(seed_fy_poc_windows_sql.gmv)
            label: 'GMV'
            format {
              type: 'number'
              pattern: '[$$]#,###0'
            }
          }
        }
      }
      settings {
        x_axis_label: 'Period'
        show_data_points: true
        sort: LineFamilySort {
          type: 'xaxis'
          direction: 'asc'
        }
      }
    }
  }

  block t_grain_note: TextBlock {
    content: @md
### One definition, five grains

**Day** and **Week** are plain calendar cuts.

**Month** keeps its calendar name—fiscal logic never renames October.

**Fiscal quarter** and **Fiscal year** are cut on Seed's Oct–Sep boundary and named by the year the fiscal year ends in.
    ;;
  }

  block t_month_note: TextBlock {
    content: @md
**How to read the calendar:** fiscal logic changes which **year** and **quarter** a date belongs to. It does not rename months—October remains October. Every window above resolves from today, so nothing breaks when the demo is shown on a different date: **Last FY** always closes on 30 September, **Last FQ** and **Last month** on their own final day, and the three current periods always run to today.
    ;;
  }


  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // TAB 2 — the same dashboard, defined in AQL
  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  block t_aql_intro: TextBlock {
    content: @md
# The same thing, without a hand-written query

Identical behaviour to the first tab. The difference is underneath: no fiscal SQL. The Oct–Sep calendar, all six relative windows and the grain switch are **AQL over a plain date spine**, and the grain is a *dynamic dimension* — one `case()` on a param — so each fact stays on a single row.
    ;;
  }
  block v_aql_selector: VizBlock {
    label: 'Choose a date-relative window'
    viz: MarkdownViz {
      dataset: seed_fy_poc_windows_aql
      rows: [
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous FY Complete'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_aql.in_previous_fy)
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Current FY to Today'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_aql.in_current_fy_to_today)
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous FQ Complete'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_aql.in_previous_fq)
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Current FQ to Today'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_aql.in_current_fq_to_today)
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Previous Month Complete'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_aql.in_previous_month)
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Current Month to Today'
          ref: r(seed_fy_poc_dates_aql.in_current_month_to_today)
        }
      ]
      content: @md <style>
   [data-uname="v_aql_selector"] .ci-viz-result {
    overflow: visible !important;
  }

  [data-uname="v_aql_selector"] .h-full {
    overflow: visible !important;
  }

  [data-uname="v_aql_selector"] .text-content, [data-uname="v_aql_selector"] .vue-markdown {
    overflow: visible !important;
  }

  [data-uname="v_aql_selector"] {
    z-index: 50 !important;
    position: relative;
  }


